OL,3,GNEWSAIntegrated education campaigners
OL,4,Ahave 'lost their way' says minister
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe minister announced his department
OL,7,Fwas "reviewing the way information is
OL,8,Fcollected for the purposes of assessing
OL,9,Freasonable numbers" to support schools
OL,10,Fand "bring greater clarity to the
OL,11,Fprocess".
